'''Tekachi''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] increases health, damage, speed, backswing and Dodge chance.

